Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:25:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] kboot: T6050: also admit the M5 Max's 27.3 GPU build
 (aura #172)

joshuaswarren's aurora-silicon/aura #172 (60a3b0fdb3) accepts the 26C5035r digest he
measured on an M5 Max, normalized with the 27.0 record offsets. Our 27.3 hand-off keeps a
table of builds, so his digest goes in as one more entry rather than a second check.

Co-authored-by: Joshua Warren <816217+joshuaswarren@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
